{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/-AoCMKhFmApcQkoyUJgLdQ","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:49:50.818052+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/-AoCMKhFmApcQkoyUJgLdQ","html":"<div><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/E2ibYDZzpQ7WKBRFC1Us97tZqOlLfYUoaYmllmtopSpicTcwEeBRl6y68OpWaFF8Z7pvfdQxubeJt9VaWclQJFSHfz8qibTGkgSczic5lrA7Kf0/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section></section><section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span> 为促进全国有志于人工智能前沿研究与实践应用的优秀大学生互动交流，培养从事高水平科研的志向。我院定于2026年7月11-13日在四川大学望江校区举办“人工智能2026优秀大学生暑期夏令营”，为优秀本科生提供了解我院学术科研环境和与专家面对面交流的机会，包括学院及学科介绍、学术论坛、团队及导师介绍交流、实验室参观等活动。此次夏令营计划面向全国高校（含本校）招收营员约120名，相关安排及注意事项公告如下：</span></p></section></section></section><section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/E2ibYDZzpQ7WDMPqVvlezf7Bm0XzTcCu1I2hF7uqT4SsEOrtnI6P4VWQrQcSPwAA5pGJRpHoPeKU8NczXicibcD3ib9bsjSIib6J2bIibH5q2xjQs/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>申请条件</span></b></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/E2ibYDZzpQ7W2MVMcUP35u0kHEU22ib6hxPSWibzp5Bl1BOH3N50XxkKD2sK88NurGMeMtCJPMFMNavwvwsRWcW9gEmql22bIf4eL8nXvwB56o/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>01</span></strong></p></section></section><section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/E2ibYDZzpQ7UjG2IImVjictbqexYHWKK2D8Z89nqnoRUtoNszDndKu7ic6kNichvlRibpCcgdw45JWAZERIH9ReFc9Cq62qtkhmqxEMra3Png4GA/640?w