7XtXeZNANYTicQAa6HlN2Jc6qnEJlTJ7drYYMANMYGmUoRK8WDwnSJtBO9f1lpDEOsE3LZKBia2RIyxbaBUicAK6xfLJ0U9cLp0wk/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>即日起接受报名，2026年7月1日截止。</span></p></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>03</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><b><span>审核录取</span></b></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/E2ibYDZzpQ7UX0Ru9iaibUsO0jqTbmNHUHn67rpTfDjAyuWELh4p4ibE40VHVQJvBTq2TKW4ZwIU6v4Ndr9EcRlGY4ObcIArJOUAUNd89IzLP6o/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><span>      </span><section><span>我院夏令营材料审核与营员录取工作预计于7月4日完成，届时将邮件发送夏令营录取通知，请考生于7月4日后在报名时预留的邮箱中查看录取通知。录取营员请及时邮件确认是否参营。</span></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/E2ibYDZzpQ7WTibiajUjeYzEtKwYrU1E5w5sDxTPRK2nd0UoZrBRQtibgakP2AmnLlmrkTuIZzKh8VBvSJXBRYVJa2d6g1aoXwVShUynoxwGm50/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>温馨提示</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/E2ibYDZzpQ7XicQBicticBlH5SGtHGUu2EZAYPibntDvCppianaS3cLuW6D7sCuEbG0jtReibWPAe0VicJhPmCibXeqgjKhERjOEiaY7v5JgIUdcqXia28/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>01</span></strong></p></section></section><section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/E2ibYDZzpQ7XzMvev89THsPiaU2ftoyGmRAfJuIuzdDQTar7IwiaRJ8HDyQibjiaGVSicyqBkPrtUFNsPPvc7Bf7beXwh3uTYt8m1Xkz2JrRyFbW4/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>营员报到时需携带身份证、学生证。按照相应安排参加各项活动。在营期间，营员必须遵守四川大学的相关规定，且做好自身的安全防护工作，在营期间进行的一切相关活动，禁止录音录像。</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>02</span></strong></p></section></section><section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/E2ibYDZzpQ7UPFVdDJ9sbcpia55K3fKlBQFZZyDDic9opWWNXWgULRc6EzvMRzdSibWJBTsEApaHwRQic4VyqnD0UT97eQbP3mpicnhXoZs27E9qE/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><span>请报名时正确填写所有信息，勿重复填写，任何弄虚作假、违反学术诚信行为一经发现，我院将取消其一切录取资格，并反馈其所在学校。</span></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>03</span></strong></p></section></section><section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/E2ibYDZzpQ7WowoQD9OuREgFGPLwT3BQ3OMS3RDto6iaVg9sTEgUVsRuH64IibtQHTy5IX8qibW05gKWsaia5fTAQMBTmE1uGbfXNkThTPfteLII/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>营员报名请妥善考虑自身时间安排，被录取后无特殊情况不得随意放弃，以免影响个人诚信记录。如遇不可抗拒因素不能参加，须第一时间与我院沟通。一旦报到，无特殊情况须全程参加夏令营。在营期间，营员须遵守四川大学相关规定和营员手册等规章制度。违反相关规定和制度者，不予发放营员证书。</span></p></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>04</span></strong></p></section></section><section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/E2ibYDZzpQ7UIRBxicolHYItVJJf1fQ0wAzdv9aN0Haiadqtj3K6tpHcpwqToXiaI3ibV3NN28b5xgcmdyxAmVjNKdnuVqCMhViavYRm3oqOEtR94/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>夏令营期间由我院安排免费食宿（本校营员不予安排住宿）。</span></p></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>05</span></strong></p></section></section><section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/E2ibYDZzpQ7UJxMBQ5FFrBpXB3KWczp9qw0seQibiaScPuVklKVWZ674ZaF3fibc5AK8gBvmZjUPQFkL39vhXvgBzd54rf1tCrNpicd8ibAHGB78k/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>往返交通费由学生个人承担。</span></p></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>06</span></strong></p></section></section><section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/E2ibYDZzpQ7VmYmoWQy51qFskZ8aFlomrXwDbYicAH0zCamzeNTMbtaoj74ibUlhVRgBPh64NaKdBNk8hlYCFdz2hf0VfELreCJ9vmlak4FTKU/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>营员前来参加夏令营活动，须事先征得所在学校和父母的同意，往返川大途中安全责任自负。对因违反四川大学相关规定和营员手册等规章制度导致的安全事故，由本人承担所有责任。</span></p></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>07</span></strong></p></section></section><section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/E2ibYDZzpQ7XIUZuOlSWLgQNy3TiafF1YkZJ6xUWOnRCtaibDOg5SdUlJUeia5pfYq9PE1Qiccib2micPrEibfx1V87a3BuHCBpBEhpGcKIl870nia9s/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>未尽事宜由人工智能学院夏令营工作领导小组负责解释。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/E2ibYDZzpQ7VkRa5aAx3lUHNTsTz38zgoedjF7BliaKribhsTaPljBBIvDASYITiasVmkicYtCxZWC07tRToAllVEn5MW7S9le9GMic1icIBXwOgdU/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>联系方式</span></b></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/E2ibYDZzpQ7WTpXtKOXCrV4erxicb2JMJQutqrC2HEBUjZ3k4uyWXj9MmM6ce91SfwVHBgRKiacdTQ3Kn8uZUgIMTW9Jib4RAd2RFhQC0YDibPO8/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section>